  "description": "High-performance similarity search and clustering of dense vectors. A from-scratch .NET port of FAISS — no native binaries, no P/Invoke — built on Span<T> and SIMD intrinsics, with an API shaped like Python FAISS. Flat, IVF, HNSW, NSG, IMI, PQ, scalar, additive (RQ, LSQ), binary and sparse indexes; filtered search, re-ranking, lock-free concurrent reads, versioned and journaled persistence, memory-mapped search.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
